      "title": "Planitop Rasa & Ripara R4",
      "h1": "Mapei Planitop Rasa & Ripara R4",
      "description": "Planitop Rasa & Ripara R4 (Planitop Smooth & Repair R4) is a fast-curing, thixotropic, fibre-reinforced cementitious mortar of class R4 for structural repairs and skim-coating of interior and exterior concrete surfaces, ",
