          "height": 828,
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Planitop Rasa &amp; Ripara R4 (Planitop Smooth &amp; Repair R4) is a fast-curing, thixotropic, fibre-reinforced cementitious mortar of class R4 for structural repairs and skim-coating of interior and exterior concrete surfaces, both horizontal and vertical. The mortar has very good fatigue behaviour, at least 300,000 cycles, and is climate-compensated over its whole life cycle.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Class R4 to EN 1504-3, type CC",
